"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-01-09T09:30:15Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T05:41:26Z","closed_at":"2025-01-09T19:22:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.4.dev7.official [46c8f8c5c]\n- I **could not** reproduce it in: v4.3.beta1.official [a4f2ea91a] as well as in v4.3.rc2.mono.official [3978628c6] which means it's a very recent regression\n\n\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev7 - Windows 10 Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.12011.1036)\n\n### Issue description\n\n\nI was writing a shader that reads from the depth texture. At first I experienced some mild problems like specular reflections being blown out but fiddling with the probe's placement mostly fixed the problem. Then I added a VoxelGI node, baked the lighting and the bug you see below happened.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cef4e778-db68-4e8f-a284-dea81f64910f)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae4e9312-8942-41b3-be00-ca82d961481a)\n\nFrom my testing this is irreversible, and only goes away once I disable the material that reads from the screen texture or just delete that part from the shader. I left some comments in the shader to shed more light on the problem\n\nThis issue was hard to find and I'm still unsure if the title is right. That's the best description I could think of.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nEnable the reflection probe - everything goes white.\nDisable the node \"river\" that reads from screen texture (and reenable the reflection probe to refresh it) and everything goes back to normal\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[probe MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18359286/probe.MRP.zip)\n\nEverything can be found in the MRP. The shader is assigned to the \"river\" mesh\n","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101336/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}